-BULLET
-{
-    name = 9mmBullet
+// NAS bullet definitions, updated for BDArmory Plus 1.13 (KSP 1.12.5).
+// - explosive/tntMass/fuzeType replace the BDAc 1.2 keys; blastPower/blastHeat/blastRadius were removed (all were 0).
+// - HE shells: explosive = Standard, tntMass unchanged. Shells fired by guns that had airDetonation = true use
+//   fuzeType = Timed (bursts at the predicted target range, also detonates on impact). Other HE uses fuzeType = Impact.
+//   Flak (proximity + timed backup) is an alternative for the AA shells, but proximity fuzes also trigger near friendly ships.
+// - AP/ball rounds: explosive = None, tntMass = 0, fuzeType = None (pure kinetic, as before).
+// - apBulletMod was 0 for every bullet; in BDArmory 1.13 that gives 0 mm penetration. HE now uses 0.8 and AP/ball 1.0
+//   (BDArmory's own conventions).
+// - Tracer colours moved here from the weapons (BDArmory 1.13 reads them from the bullet).
+// - 9mmBullet renamed 9mmBulletNAS: BDArmory defines its own 9mmBullet and skips duplicate names.
+BULLET
+{
+	name = 9mmBulletNAS	// was 9mmBullet in NAS 0.7.0
+	DisplayName = 9mm Ball (Sten)
 	caliber = 9
