diff --git a/GameData/NAS/Changelog.txt b/GameData/NAS/Changelog.txt
index 6743042..6378ab0 100644
--- a/GameData/NAS/Changelog.txt
+++ b/GameData/NAS/Changelog.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,18 @@
-﻿0.7.0 (IMPORTANT) - "Land of Dragon"
+﻿0.7.0-bda1.13 (UNOFFICIAL) - community update for KSP 1.12.5 + BDArmory Plus 1.13
+Not an official Kerwis/NAS release. See CHANGES.md in the patch set for details.
+Removed the bundled ModuleManager 3.0.6 and Firespitter 7.6 (install current ModuleManager 4.x and Firespitter 7.17+ separately).
+Rebuilt AntiSubmarineWeapon.dll (0.6.6.0) against BDArmory Plus 1.13 / .NET Framework 4.8.
+Depth charges no longer reset to the toolbar depth on launch; they keep the depth set in the editor.
+Depth charges wait for BDArmory's safe-arming distance before detonating, and get a native BDArmory depth fuze at max depth as a backstop.
+Torpedo propellers now use the RPM/direction from their part configs.
+Bullets: replaced BDAc 1.2 keys with BDArmory 1.13 ones (explosive/fuzeType/apBulletMod/tracer colours). AA shells use Timed fuzes.
+Fixed every bullet having apBulletMod = 0 (zero armour penetration in BDArmory 1.13).
+Weapons: removed airDetonation/airDetonationTiming/maxAirDetonationRange, defaultAirDetonationRange -> defaultDetonationRange, weaponType cannon -> ballistic.
+Radars: removed obsolete rangeIncrements/slaveTurrets/boresightScan, fixed canReceiveRadarData spelling, removed the duplicate canLock that let FuMO 61 lock.
+Removed ModuleKineticBombarder (no KSP 1.12 plugin) and the obsolete BDACategoryModule.
+Renamed bullet 9mmBullet to 9mmBulletNAS (BDArmory ships its own 9mmBullet).
+
+0.7.0 (IMPORTANT) - "Land of Dragon"
 Used new compression method to get a slightly lighter package.
 Updated plugin to adapt to latest BDArmory Continued.
 Tweaked yaw speed of 12.7 cm/50 cal Type 3 Naval Gun Dual Mount Turret up to 6 dps.
